      "description": "Assign declared outputs exactly once from final scan state: hiAlarm := hiAlarmState; loAlarm := loAlarmState; error := selected error value; status := selected status code. Invalid-configuration scans preserve the previous alarm output states while updating error/status; valid-configuration scans output the newly computed hysteresis alarm states."
